title: Drawers3B
---
// Talk target of the chest of drawers in 3B (Hotspots layer). On moving day he puts the
// blush socks here or in the box (box_3b.yarn). Each box starts the same way: on Sunday
// they are in the drawers and he can wear them or hang them on the rack (rack_3b.yarn);
// $r1_socks_at (drawers, rack, feet) says where they are while he isn't holding them. On
// the second Thursday they start on the rack, not here.
-> Put the blush socks away <<if can("R1MoveIn", "stow") and $item_blush_socks>>
    <<set $item_blush_socks to false>>
    <<done R1MoveIn stow>>
    You: Top drawer. Next to the grey ones.
    <<if is_done("R1MoveIn", "rules")>>
        <<note r1_move "Unpacked. Bed.">>
    <<else>>
        <<note r1_move "Answer the door.">>
    <<endif>>
-> Put the blush socks on <<if can("R1Breakfast", "wear") and not is_done("R1Breakfast", "door") and $r1_socks_at == "drawers">>
    <<set $r1_socks_at to "feet">>
    <<done R1Breakfast wear>>
    You: Fine. Blush.
-> Look
    <<if in_box("R1Dinner2") and not $r1_thu2_knocked>>
        // PLACEHOLDER lines.
        You: Not in the drawer. I washed them. They're drying somewhere.
        <<set $r1_thu2_socks_noted to true>>
        <<note thu2_socks "The socks?">>
    <<elseif in_box("R1Viewing")>>
        You: Somebody's drawers. Empty.
    <<else>>
        You: Shirts, mostly grey. Socks, mostly grey.
    <<endif>>
===
